gin="00:50.600" end="00:50.840">you </span><span begin="00:50.840" end="00:51.050">at </span><span begin="00:51.050" end="00:51.590">all</span><span begin="00:51.590" end="00:51.650">!</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.650" end="00:55.430"><span begin="00:51.650" end="00:51.980">I </span><span begin="00:51.980" end="00:52.400">like </span><span begin="00:52.400" end="00:52.700">the </span><span begin="00:52.700" end="00:53.240">kick </span><span begin="00:53.240" end="00:53.540">in </span><span begin="00:53.540" end="00:53.840">the </span><span begin="00:53.840" end="00:55.430">face</span><span begin="00:55.430" end="00:55.430">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.430" end="00:57.500"><span begin="00:55.430" end="00:55.520">And </span><span begin="00:55.520" end="00:55.640">the </span><span begin="00:55.640" end="00:56.120">things </span><span begin="00:56.120" end="00:56.360">you </span><span begin="00:56.360" end="00:56.660">do </span><span begin="00:56.660" end="00:56.750">to </span><span begin="00:56.750" end="00:57.410">me</span><span begin="00:57.410" end="00:57.500">!</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.500" end="01:01.040"><span begin="00:57.500" end="00:57.800">I </span><span begin="00:57.800" end="00:58.280">love </span><span begin="00:58.280" end="00:58.460">the </span><span begin="00:58.460" end="00:58.970">way </span><span begin="00:58.970" end="00:59.480">that </span><span begin="00:59.480" end="00:59.750">it </span><span begin="00:59.750" end="00:59.870">hurts</span><span begin="00:59.870" end="01:01.040">!</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.040" end="01:09.200"><span begin="01:01.040" end="01:01.070">I </span><span begin="01:01.070" end="01:01.160">don't </span><span begin="01:01.160" end="01:01.580">miss </span><span begin="01:01.580" end="01:01.790">you</span><span begin="01:01.790" end="01:01.790">, </span><span begin="01:01.790" end="01:01.880">I </span><span begin="01:01.880" end="01:02.120">miss </span><span begin="01:02.120" end="01:02.300">the </span><span begin="01:02.300" end="01:03.140">misery</span><span begin="01:03.140" end="01:09.200">!</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.200" end="01:15.080"><span begin="01:09.200" end="01:09.500">I've </span><span begin="01:09.500" end="01:09.980">tried </span><span begin="01:09.980" end="01:10.430">but </span><span begin="01:10.430" end="01:10.610">I </span><span begin="01:10.610" end="01:11.030">just </span><span begin="01:11.030" end="01:11.390">can't </span><span begin="01:11.390" end="01:12.290">take </span><span begin="01:12.290" end="01:14.060">it</span><span begin="01:14.060" end="01:15.080">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.080" end="01:19.400"><span begin="01:15.080" end="01:15.380">I'd </span><span begin="01:15.380" end="01:16.040">rather </span><span begin="01:16.040" end="01:16.550">fight </span><span begin="01:16.550" end="01:16.880">than </span><span begin="01:16.880" end="01:17.240">just </span><span begin="01:17.240" end="01:18.170">fake </span><span begin="01:18.170" end="01:19.400">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.400" end="01:20.810"><span begin="01:19.400" end="01:19.430">（</span><span begin="01:19.430" end="01:19.610">'Cause </span><span begin="01:19.610" end="01:19.850">I </span><span begin="01:19.850" end="01:20.120">like </span><span begin="01:20.120" end="01:20.240">it </span><span begin="01:20.240" end="01:20.780">rough</span><span begin="01:20.780" end="01:20.790">）</span><span begin="01:20.790" end="01:20.810">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.810" end="01:23.870"><span begin="01:20.810" end="01:21.260">You </span><span begin="01:21.260" end="01:21.650">know </span><span begin="01:21.650" end="01:22.130">that </span><span begin="01:22.130" end="01:22.430">I've </span><span begin="01:22.430" end="01:22.880">had </span><span begin="01:22.880" end="01:23.810">enough</span><span begin="01:23.810" end="01:23.870">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.870" end="01:26.540"><spa